      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a2727284922802a5b3823054e4adf2134c568bc63f28ddeb2df5621b0912dc4d",
        "slc_f4d78ef743c48414ee9268f55d591ab96f5ef11c7a59857177a95874cbb39085"
      ],
      "text": "The README describes MiniCode as a lightweight terminal coding assistant for local development, offering Claude Code-like workflow and architectural ideas in a much smaller implementation aimed at learning, experimentation, and custom tooling."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_49627410332c511d185a16e477eecb60833204ead2a36933c7761350a2d2e518",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d",
          "git_sha": "3d70af3159020184408f5ac297c23d44bf13df04",
          "line_end": 136,
          "line_start": 125,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "liumengxuan04/minicode",
          "url": "https://github.com/LiuMengxuan04/MiniCode/blob/40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d/README.md#L125-L136"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6589827965ed3041611eaf6039dc702223a97b5551d1c4f407d2e3d745b8fc71"
      ],
      "text": "Documented core capabilities include multi-step tool execution within a single turn, forming a model-to-tool-to-model loop."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_72f5babcd14862814804547e09713d8b4dd2fab801551c1bcc46938470d0bbc5",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d",
          "git_sha": "9726b30de3643ab84bc925d345271949242bf137",
          "line_end": 87,
          "line_start": 83,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "liumengxuan04/minicode",
          "url": "https://github.com/LiuMengxuan04/MiniCode/blob/40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d/ARCHITECTURE.md#L83-L87"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_aaefda37c71ef1de51fb89e943014fe1cfb9b7008bf6bc2bdc8ab14eb91b62cd"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation describes a root agent that can spawn up to three concurrent read-only sub-agents restricted to file search/read, skill loading, and web research tools; sub-agents cannot edit files, run commands, ask the user, or spawn further agents, and the root owns every code change."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_dca464b68ac577dbf8fb71231ce1326e3f24725f39a523ad159ca7bb687f524c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d",
          "git_sha": "9726b30de3643ab84bc925d345271949242bf137",
          "line_end": 89,
          "line_start": 89,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "liumengxuan04/minicode",
          "url": "https://github.com/LiuMengxuan04/MiniCode/blob/40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d/ARCHITECTURE.md#L89-L89"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5255c13fcea2ad38a620f68e4ae50c1cb732366ddd5fb10eebe5b20525154f79"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation states this multi-agent MVP does not persist workers, load .claude/agents, support nesting, isolate worktrees, or allow live user steering, framing itself as a minimal teaching implementation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_114825a60fc34c1d8d312ca1f7f56dce379c14b0e1f7b1c7460e98bae80d9baa",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d",
          "git_sha": "9726b30de3643ab84bc925d345271949242bf137",
          "line_end": 40,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "liumengxuan04/minicode",
          "url": "https://github.com/LiuMengxuan04/MiniCode/blob/40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d/ARCHITECTURE.md#L31-L40"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a5ba49b56a0c6b1f018f3b70dc9833325c06e02d8aa388b7f107603d1b27a9b8"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation lists planned-but-not-built items including full Ink/React rendering, bridge/IDE two-way communication, remote sessions, LSP support, and a skill marketplace, while noting a minimal sub-agent runtime and basic layered memory loading are already implemented."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4c019ef5a773046599f77e39a45913620653c5c44c0177de1818ae771b0fea28",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d",
          "git_sha": "9726b30de3643ab84bc925d345271949242bf137",
          "line_end": 77,
          "line_start": 72,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "liumengxuan04/minicode",
          "url": "https://github.com/LiuMengxuan04/MiniCode/blob/40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d/ARCHITECTURE.md#L72-L77"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3ac489b4de7f24582cb67f42475344c0076a95f6f3ea842457771404bf2f59a7"
      ],
      "text": "Documented runtime state keeps conversation messages in memory during a turn, appends them to a per-project session log after each successful turn, and treats fresh provider-reported usage as the source of truth for context accounting, with local token estimation only as a fallback or a tail estimate."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_40dc4f5aef9806c88552096ddcb9375b567853316f3303e9b0a1ef977b11fcd0",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d",
          "git_sha": "9726b30de3643ab84bc925d345271949242bf137",
          "line_end": 77,
          "line_start": 72,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "liumengxuan04/minicode",
          "url": "https://github.com/LiuMengxuan04/MiniCode/blob/40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d/ARCHITECTURE.md#L72-L77"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3ac489b4de7f24582cb67f42475344c0076a95f6f3ea842457771404bf2f59a7"
      ],
      "text": "Documentation states very large tool outputs are moved out of the prompt context and stored on disk, leaving the model a preview and a path to the full output."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1d421d22562b7bb527ea10cec246578cb8fff75827e6a436c6038e20690e5f91",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d",
          "git_sha": "3d70af3159020184408f5ac297c23d44bf13df04",
          "line_end": 190,
          "line_start": 178,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "liumengxuan04/minicode",
          "url": "https://github.com/LiuMengxuan04/MiniCode/blob/40413758cc12892528d31c85edbe53e97e25a88d/README.md#L178-L190"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_593c536de0565590822a091be625b2c4bac8f181d880cf7cb5c204f032128f62"
      ],
      "text": "Documented slash commands include /plan for an in-memory Todo list, /goal with pause/resume for a Goal that persists across turns, and /loop for a recurring prompt with a default ten-minute interval and a one-minute minimum."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_0edf5e8ace2f01205b327aa8b3d78fcc88f576721201043a63721ea1ad96b9ae",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
